            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for to loot, then the Marathi for to fleece."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: किंचाळणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किंचाळणे — kiñcāḷṇe — \"to scream; to shriek\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "साप बघून ती जोरात किंचाळली. sāp baghūn tī jorāt kiñcāḷlī. She screamed loudly when she saw the snake."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो किंचाळला, to kiñcāḷlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Intransitive: जोरात किंचाळणे (kiñcāḷṇe), to scream aloud."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किंचाळणे (kiñcāḷṇe) is a Marathi verb of crying out; CDIAL gathers the Marathi word for a shriek under the cry-word kīkkati, 'screams' (CDIAL 3192), but the verb itself is not listed and its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
