          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गोंधळ — gondhaḷ — \"commotion; confusion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वीज गेल्यावर सभागृहात एकच गोंधळ झाला. vīj gelyāvar sabhāgṛhāt ekac gondhaḷ jhālā. When the power went out, the hall was in total commotion."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गोंधळ (gondhaḷ) होणे, a commotion breaks out; गोंधळात पडणे, to be confused."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गोंधळ (gondhaḷ) is the Marathi word for an uproar or a muddle; its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
