              "text": "जमाव — jamāv — \"a mob; a gathered crowd\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अपघाताच्या ठिकाणी मोठा जमाव जमला. apghātācyā ṭhikāṇī moṭhā jamāv jamlā. A large crowd gathered at the scene of the accident."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on जमणे, to gather. गर्दी is any crowd; जमाव (jamāv) is one that has gathered round something."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
