          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जमाव (jamāv) is built on jamṇe, 'to gather', which CDIAL lists, as Marathi 'to collect', under Sanskrit yamyate (CDIAL 10428)."
            }
